## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a practical online ICA pipeline under real-time constraints and nonstationary audio. It also probes decisions about whitening, joint diagonalization, and permutation under resource limits, plus simple robustness and evaluation plan.

## Key Concepts
- Online whitening with forgetting factor
- Joint diagonalization vs per-bin ICA
- Cross-bin permutation using magnitude/phase cues
- Outlier handling for impulsive wind noise
- Embedded latency constraints
- Ground-truth based evaluation

